{"id":"en_the-dragon-queen-they-lost","title":"The Dragon Queen They Lost","titleEn":"The Dragon Queen They Lost","description":"In the Solis Empire, where winter never ends, the sun can only be restored through a union between a princess of untainted royal lineage and the Abyss Dragon. Princess Diana spent a joyful childhood with her three brothers until Lorelei appeared. Wielding a stolen Dragon's scale, Lorelei took from Diana both the affection she was given and her place in the family. Fooled by the deception, the brothers turned against Diana and gave her up as an offering meant to kill the dragon. The truth only came to light once the dragon had already carried Diana away, and by that point nothing could be undone.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-dragon-queen-they-lost/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-dragon-queen-they-lost/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Strong Heroine","Werewolf","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4l4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-dragon-queen-they-lost_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4l4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-dragon-queen-they-lost_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4l4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-dragon-queen-they-lost_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4l4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-dragon-queen-they-lost_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0